{title: Everybody Ought To Know}
{key: F}
{x_theme: blood, cross}
{x_source: chrd:everybody_ought_to_know.chrd}

{comment: Chorus}
Everybody ought to [F]know.
Everybody ought to [F]know.
Everybody ought to [C7]know who Jesus [F]is.

{comment: Verse 1}
[F]He's the lily of the [Bb]valley.
[F]He's the brighter morning [C]star.
[F]He's the fairest of ten [Bb]thousand.
[F]Everybody [C7]ought to [F]know.

{comment: Verse 2}
[F]On the cross He died [Bb]for sinners
[F]And His blood makes white [C]as snow
[F]Loving, living, coming [Bb]Savior
[F]He's the [C7]One you [F]ought to know.
